{"id":"8790486ac053461c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","title":"Category Theory","display":"df-category-theory — Category Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-category-theory","aliases":["58-df-category-theory","Category Theory"],"display":"df-category-theory — Category Theory","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-category-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-category-theory</span><span>Category Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category-theory — Category Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (small-category predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in C_1\\times C_1:t(f)=s(g)\\}\n\\land s,t\\in C_0^{C_1}\n\\land e\\in C_1^{C_0}\n\\land c\\in C_1^P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;(s(e(a))=a\\land t(e(a))=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\n\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g,h\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}c(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in C_1\\times C_1:t(f)=s(g)\\}\n\\land s,t\\in C_0^{C_1}\n\\land e\\in C_1^{C_0}\n\\land c\\in C_1^P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;(s(e(a))=a\\land t(e(a))=a)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\n\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g,h\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}c(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All six components are recovered existentially from the category code; the truth of the unary predicate no longer depends on free ambient component variables.</li>\n<li>Category: objects and morphisms with composition</li>\n<li>Functors and natural transformations are downstream structures; keeping them out of this atom removes the former category/functor dependency cycle.</li>\n<li>Limits: universal objects in diagram categories</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e,P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land P=\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in C_1\\times C_1:t(f)=s(g)\\}\n\\land s,t\\in C_0^{C_1}\n\\land e\\in C_1^{C_0}\n\\land c\\in C_1^P\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in C_0\\;(s(e(a))=a\\land t(e(a))=a)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\n\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g,h\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\\\\\n&\\hspace{5em}c(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)\n=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1726,"backlinks":[{"id":"7cd0504ab191f721","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)$ (category data, see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])"},{"id":"cfff0ee698e54323","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$ (category predicate; see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])"},{"id":"a556f16d9432aae2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle$ 且 $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)$（see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）"},{"id":"ff4636701b68a3a3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$ (explicit category-structure predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])"},{"id":"be043eb55dfff728","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])"},{"id":"8d3eef48d90e1884","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])"},{"id":"06030f0452dddcf8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）"},{"id":"610f23ee04365803","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）"},{"id":"4922f5599894afb1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）"},{"id":"e200883e5728e41f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca227784015c4bc0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}$ 取 [[58-df-category-theory]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-category-theory]]"},{"id":"8